 <section class="section" id="comparison"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head rise"><span class="section-index">Feature comparison</span><div><h2>What you get for the price</h2><p>One column shows the typical VA outcome, the other the AI Operations Employee experience. The 12-month totals assume managed VA at minimum monthly rates plus any listed setup; AI pricing uses the founding pilot rates.</p></div></div><div class="pricing-table rise"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Metric</th><th scope="col" class="va-col">Virtual Assistant</th><th scope="col" class="ai-col">AI Operations Employee</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Monthly cost</th><td><span data-claim="Wing VA monthly plans run $699 to $2,999 per month" data-source="https://www.wishup.co/blog/how-much-does-a-virtual-assistant-cost" data-checked="2026-08-22">$699–$2,999 (managed)</span></td><td class="ai-price"><span class="accent">$199<span class="unit">/month</span></span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Setup cost</th><td>$0–$500 (onboarding)</td><td data-claim="Stromation AI Operations Employee founding-pilot pricing: $250 one-time setup plus $199 per month" data-source="https://stromation.com/operations-employee/" data-checked="2026-08-22">$250 one-time</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">12-month total</th><td data-claim="Wing VA monthly plans run $699 to $2,999 per month" data-source="https://www.wishup.co/blog/how-much-does-a-virtual-assistant-cost" data-checked="2026-08-22">$8,388–$36,238</td><td class="ai-total">$2,638</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Availability</th><td>Business hours</td><td>24/7</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Response time</th><td>Hours to 1 day</td><td>Minutes</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Handles volume spikes</th><td>Requires more hours/cost</td><td>Same price</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Human judgment</th><td>Yes</td><td>Escalates to you</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Best for</th><td data-claim="Best for complex tasks, sensitive calls" data-source="https://www.stromation.com/workers/" data-checked="2026-08-22">Complex tasks, sensitive calls</td><td data-claim="Best for inbox triage, classification, follow-up, routing" data-source="https://www.stromation.com/workers/" data-checked="2026-08-22">Inbox triage, classification, follow-up, routing</td></tr></tbody></table><p class="pricing-note">All figures are USD. 12-month total = (12 × monthly minimum) + one-time setup. AI total = (12 × $199) + $250. VA ranges reflect published minimum monthly plans for each provider where listed; otherwise $699/month minimum for Wing-style managed service.</p></div></div></section>
 <section class="section tint" id="when-va-makes-sense"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head rise"><span class="section-index">When a VA beats AI</span><div><h2>Where human judgment still wins</h2><p>AI Operations Employee excels at structured inbox work. For tasks requiring nuanced human interaction, a virtual assistant remains the better choice.</p></div></div><div class=" pros-cons"><div class="pro"><h3>Stick with a VA if you need</h3><ul><li>Negotiation or high-stakes conversation handling</li><li>Complex calendar coordination across multiple stakeholders</li><li>Travel planning with real-time changes</li><li>Hand-holding on emotional or sensitive situations</li><li>Face-to-face or phone-only meeting representation</li></ul></div><div class="con"><h3>AI is the better buy if your work is</h3><ul><li>Recurring email intake (inquiries, bookings, complaints)</li><li>Form submissions that need classification</li><li>Standard follow-up sequences inside a written boundary</li><li>Routing messages to the right internal person</li><li>Daily summary reports with counts and trends</li></ul></div></div></div></section>
 <section class="section" id="methodology" data-methodology><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head rise"><span class="section-index">How this was measured</span><div><h2>Source and verification</h2><p>Pricing figures sourced from published rate pages of VA providers (myoutdesk.com, wishup.co, elitevagirls.com, cherryassistant.com) read on 2026-08-22. 12-month totals calculated from published monthly minimums plus one-time setup where listed. AI Operations Employee pricing from stromation.com/operations-employee/ read 2026-08-22. No account creation was required or performed. Where providers listed a range, the lower bound represents the minimum monthly plan; higher tiers increase the cost proportionally.</p><p>Last verified <time datetime="2026-08-22">August 22, 2026</time>.</p></div></div></div></section>
